  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“I know it’s hard for you, but not for me.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Overwhelming soul 3rd</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You are treated as though you have accepted 1 burn when determining the effect of your elemental defense. At 6th level, and every 3 levels thereafter, you are treated as having accepted an additional burn in your elemental defense. If you have more than 1 elemental defense, you can split this effective burn between them in whatever way you wish.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat cannot allow you to be treated as accepting more burn than would normally be allowed by an elemental defense.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc51\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
